## 🛠️ Global Rate Limiting (Burp Suite Configuration)
Before configuring specific modules, you must restrict Burp Suite globally so it never breaks the policy rules.
## 1. Global Throttling Setup

   1. Open Burp Suite.
   2. Go to Settings (gear icon in the top right) -> Tools -> HTTP.
   3. Scroll down to Handling.
   4. Check Set maximum concurrent requests and change the value to 5.
   5. Check Delay between requests (ms) and set it to 200 (this ensures exactly 5 requests per second max).

